---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../../data/navigation';
import { getBreadcrumbSchema } from '../../lib/structured-data';

const breadcrumbItems = [
  { name: 'Our Story', url: '/our-story/' }
];
const breadcrumbSchema = getBreadcrumbSchema(breadcrumbItems);
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Our Story & Heritage | Turkish Guilds, British Sensibility | Cabivella UK"
  description="Discover how Cabivella unites centuries-old Istanbul timber joinery guilds with restrained British architectural cabinetry for considered UK homes."
  canonicalPath="/our-story/"
  image="/assets/img/istanbul-heritage-panorama@2x.webp"
  structuredData={breadcrumbSchema}
>
  <!-- Giant Architectural Panorama Hero (Directly Under Header) -->
  <section class="story-giant-panorama-stage" aria-label="Istanbul Architectural Timber Lineage">
    <div class="giant-panorama-inner" data-reveal>
      <div class="giant-panorama-frame">
        <picture>
          <source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/img/istanbul-heritage-panorama@2x.webp 2048w, /assets/img/istanbul-heritage-panorama.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width: 1440px) 100vw, 1440px" />
          <img 
            src="/assets/img/istanbul-heritage-panorama@2x.webp" 
            alt="Panoramic architectural line engraving of Istanbul woodworking heritage, historic minarets, timber mansions and the Galata Tower" 
            width="2048" 
            height="978" 
            class="giant-panorama-image"
            loading="eager"
            decoding="async"
            fetchpriority="high"
          />
        </picture>
      </div>
      <div class="giant-panorama-meta">
        <span class="meta-tag">ARCHITECTURAL PEDIGREE & PROVENANCE</span>
        <p class="meta-desc">The Bosphorus Guilds to the British Terrace &bull; Centuries of master timber shaping engineered for UK homes</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbItems} />

  <!-- Ghost Watermark Header (Soft Neutral & Controlled Dynamic Bounds) -->
  <div class="ghost-watermark-container" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1200 110" class="ghost-watermark-svg">
      <text x="600" y="65" class="ghost-watermark-text" font-size="86">OUR HERITAGE</text>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <!-- Editorial Hero Section -->
  <section class="wrap story-hero-section">
    <div class="story-hero-header" data-reveal>
      <span class="section-eyebrow">TWO CENTURIES OF TIMBER MASTERY</span>
      <h1>
        Turkish master joinery.<br />
        <em>Considered British homes.</em>
      </h1>
      <p class="story-hero-lead">
        For generations, bespoke cabinetry in the United Kingdom has forced a binary choice: settle for flat-pack compromises that decay in British humidity, or pay exorbitant five-figure markups to subsidise Mayfair and Chelsea showrooms. Cabivella was founded to dismantle that compromise.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Editorial Narrative: The Bridge Between Two Worlds -->
  <section class="wrap story-narrative-section">
    <div class="narrative-grid">
      <!-- Left Column: Core Philosophy -->
      <div class="narrative-column" data-reveal>
        <span class="section-eyebrow">THE CRAFT HERITAGE</span>
        <h2>Two centuries of timber mastery, engineered for UK living.</h2>
        <p>
          Along the shores of the Golden Horn and the wooded hills of the Bosphorus, Turkish cabinetmakers have guarded an uninterrupted lineage of timber shaping. From imperial palaces requiring intricate mortise-and-tenon joints to grand Levantine waterfront mansions engineered against coastal moisture, wood was never treated as mere commodity—it was an architectural covenant.
        </p>
        <p>
          Yet, British domestic architecture demands something remarkably distinct: quiet restraint. A London Victorian townhouse with its characterful chimney alcoves, a Cotswolds stone cottage with uneven floors, or an Edinburgh tenement flat cannot tolerate ostentation. They demand quiet proportions, timeless Shaker stiles, tactile finishes, and storage that brings serene order to everyday domestic chaos.
        </p>
        <blockquote class="story-quote">
          "We do not build furniture for showroom photographs. We build cabinetry for real British mornings, crowded family suppers, and rooms that must endure decades of daily touch."
        </blockquote>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: The Four Pillars -->
      <div class="narrative-column" data-reveal>
        <span class="section-eyebrow">THE FOUR UNCOMPROMISING TRUTHS</span>
        
        <div class="truth-card">
          <div class="truth-number">01</div>
          <div class="truth-content">
            <h3>Kiln-Dried FSC Hardwoods</h3>
            <p>
              British central heating is notoriously unforgiving on timber. We kiln-dry our European Ash and Oak to strict 8–10% equilibrium moisture content, ensuring doors will never bow, twist, or bind through wet English winters.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="truth-card">
          <div class="truth-number">02</div>
          <div class="truth-content">
            <h3>Austrian Precision Motion Mechanics</h3>
            <p>
              Behind every traditional Shaker rail lies state-of-the-art European engineering. We fit heavy-gauge steel concealed soft-close hinges and drawer runners tested to over 200,000 cycles for whisper-quiet everyday glide.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="truth-card">
          <div class="truth-number">03</div>
          <div class="truth-content">
            <h3>Zero Showroom Markups</h3>
            <p>
              We do not maintain £400,000/year high-street showrooms in Central London. Every pound you invest goes directly into solid hardwood carcasses, baked polyurethane paint, and master craftsman hours.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="truth-card">
          <div class="truth-number">04</div>
          <div class="truth-content">
            <h3>Direct Workshop-to-Site Logistics</h3>
            <p>
              Cabinetry is fabricated to the exact millimetre in our dedicated Turkish workshops, packaged in protective reinforced export crates, and delivered nationwide across the UK with dedicated transit tracking.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Technical Integrity & Craft Process -->
  <section class="story-process-section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-header" style="text-align: center; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto 50px;" data-reveal>
        <span class="section-eyebrow">FROM BRIEF TO INSTALLATION</span>
        <h2>How your bespoke project unfolds.</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px;">A friction-free architectural journey tailored to UK homeowners, architects, and builders.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="process-steps-grid" data-reveal-group>
        <div class="process-step-card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
          <span class="step-badge">STEP 1</span>
          <h4>Room Brief & Drawings</h4>
          <p>Share your architectural floorplans, sketches, or rough wall dimensions. We discuss your lifestyle cadence, appliance requirements, and storage priorities.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="process-step-card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
          <span class="step-badge">STEP 2</span>
          <h4>Millimetre 3D Elevation</h4>
          <p>Our design studio prepares comprehensive architectural elevations, specifying rail widths, internal drawer tray configurations, and service voids.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="process-step-card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3">
          <span class="step-badge">STEP 3</span>
          <h4>Timber & Swatch Approval</h4>
          <p>We dispatch physical paint swatches, timber sample blocks, and aged brass hardware directly to your address for natural daylight review in your room.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="process-step-card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="4">
          <span class="step-badge">STEP 4</span>
          <h4>Master Fabrication & UK Delivery</h4>
          <p>Crafted over 4 to 8 weeks in our specialist workshops, fully dry-fitted, inspected, and delivered directly to your kerbside or room of choice across Great Britain.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Personal Accountability & Direct Access -->
  <section class="wrap" style="padding: 80px var(--edge) 90px;">
    <div class="leadership-card" data-reveal>
      <div class="leadership-content">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">DIRECT LEADERSHIP & ACCOUNTABILITY</span>
        <h2>Personal involvement on every British commission.</h2>
        <p>
          Cabivella operates on old-fashioned personal accountability. When you entrust us with your kitchen, bathroom, or fitted storage project, your enquiry is reviewed personally by company leadership. No call centres, no sales scripts—just direct joinery dialogue.
        </p>

        <div class="leadership-credentials">
          <div class="credential-item">
            <strong>Barış Bağırlı</strong>
            <span>Managing Director & Founder</span>
          </div>
          <div class="credential-item">
            <strong>Nationwide UK Service</strong>
            <span>London, Home Counties & Regional Deliveries</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="leadership-actions">
          <a href={siteConfig.whatsappUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="solid-btn" style="background: #25D366; border-color: #25D366;">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M12.031 6.172c-3.181 0-5.767 2.586-5.768 5.766-.001 1.298.38 2.27 1.019 3.287l-.711 2.598 2.664-.698c.969.584 1.961.947 2.796.947 3.179 0 5.766-2.587 5.766-5.766 0-3.18-2.587-5.734-5.766-5.734zm9.969 5.766c0 5.518-4.482 10-10 10-1.745 0-3.38-.45-4.814-1.238l-7.186 1.882 1.916-6.996c-.888-1.488-1.396-3.23-1.396-5.088 0-5.518 4.482-10 10-10s10 4.482 10 10z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>WhatsApp Barış Bağırlı (+44 7898 262110)</span>
          </a>

          <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`} class="solid-btn">
            <span>Email Leadership ({siteConfig.email})</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">✉</span>
          </a>

          <a href={siteConfig.linkedinUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="header-outline-btn">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#0A66C2" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M19 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14m-.5 15.5v-5.3a3.26 3.26 0 0 0-3.26-3.26c-.85 0-1.84.52-2.28 1.3v-1.11h-2.79v8.37h2.79v-4.93c0-.77.62-1.4 1.39-1.4a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 1.4 1.4v4.93h2.75M6.46 10.9v8.37H9.2V10.9H6.46M7.83 6.32a1.62 1.62 0 1 0 0 3.24 1.62 1.62 0 0 0 0-3.24Z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>LinkedIn Profile</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Band -->
  <section class="cta-band" aria-labelledby="story-cta-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div data-reveal>
        <span class="section-eyebrow" style="color: #d1b88e;">START YOUR JOURNEY</span>
        <h2 id="story-cta-title">Begin a conversation about your room.</h2>
        <p>Whether you are in the planning stages of a kitchen redesign or require bespoke cabinetry for a client project, we are here to assist.</p>
        
        <div class="cta-band-actions">
          <a href="/enquire/" class="solid-btn" style="background: var(--gold-warm); color: #1a241c !important;">
            <span>Submit a Project Enquiry</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/collections/kitchens/" class="solid-btn" style="background: transparent; border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); color: #fff !important;">
            <span>Explore Kitchen Collections</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  /* Giant Architectural Panorama Hero (Directly Under Header) */
  .story-giant-panorama-stage {
    width: 100%;
    background: #faf8f4;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 30px 0 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .giant-panorama-inner {
    max-width: 1440px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--edge);
  }

  .giant-panorama-frame {
    width: 100%;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #e7e2d6;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: clamp(16px, 2.5vw, 36px) clamp(14px, 2vw, 30px) clamp(10px, 1.5vw, 20px);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 44px rgba(23, 31, 25, 0.06);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .giant-panorama-frame picture {
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .giant-panorama-image {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-height: clamp(340px, 48vw, 620px);
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
    filter: contrast(1.05);
  }

  .giant-panorama-meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 16px 4px 18px;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .meta-tag {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--gold-dark);
  }

  .meta-desc {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #555f56;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .story-hero-section {
    padding-bottom: 50px;
    max-width: 1140px;
  }

  .story-hero-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto 36px;
  }

  .story-hero-header h1 {
    font-size: clamp(38px, 4.8vw, 68px);
    margin: 12px 0 20px;
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  .story-hero-lead {
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.35vw, 19px);
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: #414b43;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* Narrative Grid */
  .story-narrative-section {
    padding: 70px var(--edge) 80px;
    max-width: 1140px;
  }

  .narrative-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 56px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .narrative-column h2 {
    font-size: clamp(26px, 2.8vw, 40px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin: 10px 0 20px;
  }

  .narrative-column p {
    font-size: 15.5px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #404942;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .story-quote {
    margin: 30px 0 0;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--gold);
    background: #f7f4ed;
    border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #2e3830;
  }

  /* Truth Cards */
  .truth-card {
    display: flex;
    gap: 18px;
    padding: 18px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .truth-card:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .truth-number {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--gold-dark);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    padding-top: 2px;
  }

  .truth-content h3 {
    font-size: 16px;
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .truth-content p {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Process Section */
  .story-process-section {
    background: #f4f0e7;
    padding: 80px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .process-steps-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 22px;
  }

  .process-step-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 24px 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(27, 36, 29, 0.04);
  }

  .step-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    background: #1b261d;
    color: #cbb48b;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .process-step-card h4 {
    font-size: 16px;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .process-step-card p {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #555f56;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Leadership Card */
  .leadership-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: clamp(32px, 5vw, 56px);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 40px rgba(18, 30, 22, 0.06);
  }

  .leadership-content h2 {
    font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 42px);
    margin: 10px 0 18px;
  }

  .leadership-content p {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #434c44;
    max-width: 820px;
  }

  .leadership-credentials {
    display: flex;
    gap: 40px;
    margin: 28px 0 32px;
    padding: 18px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .credential-item strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .credential-item span {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .leadership-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
  }

  /* Responsive Breakpoints */
  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .narrative-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }
    .process-steps-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .process-steps-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .leadership-card {
      padding: 24px 16px;
    }
    .leadership-credentials {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .leadership-actions {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .leadership-actions .solid-btn,
    .leadership-actions .header-outline-btn {
      width: 100%;
      white-space: normal;
      text-align: center;
      justify-content: center;
      word-break: break-word;
      font-size: 11.5px;
      padding: 10px 14px;
    }
    .story-hero-header h1 {
      font-size: 28px;
    }
    .giant-panorama-stage {
      padding: 16px 0 0;
    }
    .giant-panorama-meta {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 10px 0 14px;
    }
  }
</style>
